<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo to build Poland car audio plant.</title>
<headline>Daewoo to build Poland car audio plant.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Electronics Co Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Daewoo Group, said on Monday it would build a $1 million car audio plant in Poland.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the plant was scheduled to start operating in March 1997 to produce 200,000 car audio systems in the first year.</p>
<p>The production capacity would increase to 500,000 in 1998 and one million by 2000, it said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
